              "content": "=Create a DALL-E 3 image prompt for this LinkedIn post topic:\n\"{{ $('Smart Topic Selector').first().json.selectedTopic }}\"\n\nBusiness type: {{ $('Business Config').first().json.businessType }}\n\nRequirements: professional, eye-catching, no text or words, LinkedIn-appropriate, photorealistic style.\nRespond with ONLY the image prompt. Nothing else."
